<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Uniphase EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Uniphase EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial said analyst Kevin Slocum raised his earnings estimates on Uniphase Corp.</p>
<p>-- Raised fiscal 1997 estimate to $0.91 per share from $0.90.</p>
<p>-- Raised fiscal 1998 estimate to $1.62 per share from $1.40.</p>
<p>-- Kept short- and long-term buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 2-3/8 to 44-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
